@FakeDataGenerator_HostAddress = http://localhost:5141

### 1. Get 5 Fake Users (English)
GET {{FakeDataGenerator_HostAddress}}/api/mock/users?count=5
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get 5 Deterministic Users (Seed = 42)
GET {{FakeDataGenerator_HostAddress}}/api/mock/users?count=5&seed=42
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get 5 Fake Users with Vietnamese Locale
GET {{FakeDataGenerator_HostAddress}}/api/mock/users?count=5&locale=vi
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get 3 Fake Orders
GET {{FakeDataGenerator_HostAddress}}/api/mock/orders?count=3
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Customer by GUID (Deterministic)
GET {{FakeDataGenerator_HostAddress}}/api/mock/customers/a3f12e84-8254-4a25-b827-02482e987111
Accept: application/json

### 6. Seed In-Memory Database Simulation
POST {{FakeDataGenerator_HostAddress}}/api/mock/seed-db
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numberOfUsers": 50,
  "numberOfOrders": 100,
  "seed": 1337
}
